          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "<p><span style=\"font-style: italic; font-weight: bold; color: #1774aa;\">Choose the correct statement.</span></p>\n<p>Prove that \\(\\underset{x→-\\infty}{lim}\\frac{8}{(x-3)^{2}}=0\\).</p>\n<p>What value of \\(N\\) guarantees that \\(\\frac{8}{(x-3)^{2}}\\) is within \\(\\varepsilon\\) of 0?</p>"
